                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb41010">Marienlyst Kurhotel</rs>. –</dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>Wir finden es hier wunderſchön u bleiben bis auf weiteres. Wie gehts? Wohin und wann
               reiſen Sie?</p>
            <closer>Herzliche Grüße <unclear>Ihnen</unclear> und<lb/>Dr. <rs type="person" ref="#pmb24648">Max</rs>.<lb/>
               <signed>Ihr Arthur</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="2">
            <closer>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb2173"/>O. S.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="3">
            <p>
               <handShift scribe="#pmb2315"/>Auf der Reiſe nach <rs type="place" ref="#pmb44252">
                  <hi rend="latintype">Gilleleje</hi>
               </rs> grüßen:</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>Lisl Gussmann.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="4">
            <closer>
               <signed>
                  <handShift scribe="#pmb12837"/>Alb. Steinrück</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
